Package: libxfce4util7
Version: @DEB_LIBXFCE4UTIL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4util/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: Utility library for the Xfce desktop environment
 libxfce4util is the basic utility (non-GTK) library shared across the Xfce
 desktop. It provides string helpers, kiosk-mode helpers and miscellaneous
 routines used by the rest of Xfce.
